silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "SigmaEncAsContainerConcreteAnchorExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_01_signature_calculus_sections_08_sigma_enc_as_container_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'SigmaEncAsContainerConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, ShapeSet_S: the concrete shape set S = {ingest, type, validate, render} of the Tartu Animal Clinic encyclopedia publication pipeline; each element is a named publish operation; the four shapes that label the nodes of a PublishTreeType tree; also, ContainerFunctor_Sigma: the publish-signature functor as container T(S lhd P)(X) = Sum_{s in S} X^{P(s)} = S x X; isomorphic to the polynomial Sigma(X) = ingest(X) + type(X) + validate(X) + render(X); applied to VetRecord_77 yields four publish-tagged copies." .
